  "design_rationale": "First-order-plus-lag heater: y_ss=amb+K*u with amb~0.14-0.15, K~1.08-1.11, tau~150-200s, lag~20-30s, downward outlier noise. Therefore PI+feedforward: ff=(target-0.15)/1.08=0.324 for 0.5 so feedback only trims residual. Kp=0.60 gives loop gain ~0.65 and closed-loop tau~100s to settle in <300s without hitting soft limit; initial boost to ~0.55 speeds 0.15->0.5 rise. Ki=0.007 with Ti~86s removes offset slowly without delay-induced oscillation. Integral gated to |e|<0.10 and clamped to +/-0.15 u-authority prevents windup during long ramp but leaves >3x the +/-0.04 ff uncertainty so no permanent offset. 10s low-pass + -0.04 downward spike gate rejects 0.02-0.08 outliers while real rate is <0.004/s. U capped at 0.60 gives y_ss~0.80<0.85 safe but enough kick; conditional freeze on saturation gives anti-windup.",
  "machine_card": "Electric heater, positive gain, self-draining to room. y in [0,1] (0=15C,1=75C), u in [0,1]. Ambient y0~0.14-0.16 (E2 ended 0.158 still falling). Gain K~1.08-1.11: y_ss~0.15+K*u. Measured: u=0.35 holds ~0.53 (E5), u=0.32 holds ~0.50-0.515 (E7), u=0.5 after 200s 0.501 still rising slope 0.0011/s (E1) implying ss~0.66-0.72. So u_ss(0.5)~0.31-0.33, use 0.324. Dynamics: 20-30s flat lag then tau~150-200s (E1 rise, E2 cool, E3 rise). Max rate ~0.004/s at useful u, worst-case bound 0.006/s. No large dead zone, roughly linear 0.30-0.50. Noise: 0.005-0.015 jitter plus isolated downward outliers 0.02-0.08 (E3,E5,E6,E7). Soft limit 0.85, hard cutoff 0.9 never approached if u<=0.60 (ss~0.80).",
  "operator_note": "Controller holds ~0.32 power to stay at 0.5 and nudges automatically. No action needed. It ignores brief downward sensor dips and limits power to 0.60 to stay well below overheat. Expect slow approach over 3-4 minutes then steady in 0.475-0.525.",
  "predicted_behavior": "From cold ~0.15: u~0.52-0.55 initially, y reaches 0.40 by ~130-170s, enters 0.475-0.525 by ~200-260s, settles to 0.495-0.505 by ~300s with overshoot <0.015 (true state) because P backs off and I is gated. After settling: MAE ~0.006-0.010, in-band >95%, steady u~0.31-0.34 (ff 0.324 plus small trim). From near target: minimal excursion, u 0.28-0.38. Energy kept low by 0.60 cap and slow integral; no oscillation, no supervisor override.",
